{"3651020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forest Ranger Services: Episode 2", "steam_appid": 3651020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Forest Ranger Services series are based on real life events and personal accounts of hikers. The narrative has been altered for entertainment purposes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are thousands of missing reports filed each year in the U.S National Parks. Many cases remain unexplained. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Chapter Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next chapter is here. Pick up from the events of the first episode and follow the story. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mystery of missing hikers in U.S. National Parks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the FBI man and his assignement. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror variety, simple puzzles and minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real voice actors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 1hour gameplay length.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new characters and discover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/9f0e7088059edda81ea252d4544747fd.poster.avif?t=1758083778\" width=596 height=299 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/9f0e7088059edda81ea252d4544747fd.webm?t=1758083778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From analog horror to classic horror scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/920bfd486678bc96eacc448486208bd5.poster.avif?t=1758083778\" width=595 height=299 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/920bfd486678bc96eacc448486208bd5.webm?t=1758083778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Forests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way to safety through creepy woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/fd07ddafc9245d4d4deeff058c41bd1a.poster.avif?t=1758083778\" width=600 height=299 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/fd07ddafc9245d4d4deeff058c41bd1a.webm?t=1758083778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Forest Ranger Services series are based on real life events and personal accounts of hikers. The narrative has been altered for entertainment purposes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are thousands of missing reports filed each year in the U.S National Parks. Many cases remain unexplained. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Chapter Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next chapter is here. Pick up from the events of the first episode and follow the story. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mystery of missing hikers in U.S. National Parks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the FBI man and his assignement. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror variety, simple puzzles and minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real voice actors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 1hour gameplay length.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new characters and discover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/9f0e7088059edda81ea252d4544747fd.poster.avif?t=1758083778\" width=596 height=299 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/9f0e7088059edda81ea252d4544747fd.webm?t=1758083778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From analog horror to classic horror scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/920bfd486678bc96eacc448486208bd5.poster.avif?t=1758083778\" width=595 height=299 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/920bfd486678bc96eacc448486208bd5.webm?t=1758083778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Forests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way to safety through creepy woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/fd07ddafc9245d4d4deeff058c41bd1a.poster.avif?t=1758083778\" width=600 height=299 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/extras/fd07ddafc9245d4d4deeff058c41bd1a.webm?t=17580